      "cooked": "<p>I am putting out a request to our very most awesome and amazing artists for a couple of pieces of Fan Art for the Wiki</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Specifically, fan art featuring groups - The Freedom Five, the Freedom Six, the Prime Wardens, the Dark watch, The Organization, The Thorathian Armada, the Crew of the La Paradoja Magnifica, and possibly Anubis (as he is lucky enough to have his own page, hah!)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you have some fan art of those groups, and want to share, let me know and we'll get some work up to flesh out those pages.</p>",
